# Timiva Layout Rules

## Purpose

These rules define how Cursor must handle layout in the Timiva project.

## Page structure

All pages must follow:

```text
Header
Main
Footer
```

Use semantic HTML:

```html
<header>
<main>
<footer>
```

## Page types

Timiva has four primary page types:

```text
Home Page
Tool Page
All Tools Page
Legal / Text Page
```

## Locked components

After Owner approval, the following are locked components:

```text
Header
Footer
Base Layout
Global background
Shared container
```

Cursor must not modify locked components unless explicitly instructed by Owner.

If modification seems necessary, Cursor must stop and report:

```text
Component:
Reason:
Affected pages:
Alternative:
Regression testing needed:
Owner approval needed:
```

## Tool page order

Tool pages should follow:

```text
Tool Hero / H1
Tool App Area
Main Result / Status Area
Input / Control Area
Related Tools
FAQ / SEO Content
Footer
```

Do not place FAQ, SEO text, or ads before the main tool experience.

## Legal pages

Legal / Text pages must not include ads.

They should use a narrow reading layout and consistent Footer.
